com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2217/md_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Slack.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2217/lg_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Slack.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2217/xl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Slack.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2217/xxl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Slack.png",{"id":99,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":100,"assetUrlXs":101,"assetUrlSm":102,"assetUrlMd":103,"assetUrlLg":104,"assetUrlXl":105,"assetUrlXxl":106},"2218","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2218/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Slack.jpg","#4A164A",{"contentTopicImage":109,"name":118,"slug":119},{"id":110,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":111,"assetUrlXs":112,"assetUrlSm":113,"assetUrlMd":114,"assetUrlLg":115,"assetUrlXl":116,"assetUrlXxl":117},"2406","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/xs_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/sm_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/md_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/lg_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/xl_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2406/xxl_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Operating_Advice.jpg","Operating Advice","operating-advice",false,"2023-09-28","Building a hit product that customers love is the first step in many founders’ journeys. However, accelerating momentum and supercharging growth to new heights requires the partnership of a product leader. ","The Playbook for Building Great Products ",{"id":125,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":5,"assetUrlXs":5,"assetUrlSm":5,"assetUrlMd":5,"assetUrlLg":5,"assetUrlXl":5,"assetUrlXxl":5},"1384",[127,131,135,138],{"instance":128},{"__typename":129,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":130},"TextBlock","Building a hit product that customers love is the first step in many founders’ journeys. However, accelerating momentum and supercharging growth to new heights requires the partnership of a product leader. IVP gathered the chief product officers charged with scaling products at [Rubrik](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/rubrik/), [Grammarly](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/grammarly/), [Slack](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/slack/), at [SaaStr](https://www.saastr.com/) Annual to share their playbook for growing a product organization to innovate on products touched by consumers and enterprises around the world.  \r\n\r\nHere is the framework Rubrik CPO [Anneka Gupta](https://www.linkedin.com/in/annekagupta/), Grammarly CPO [Noam Lovinsky](https://www.linkedin.com/in/noaml/) and IVP’s [Tamar Yehoshua](https://www.linkedin.com/in/tamar-yehoshua-886217/), the former CPO at Slack, discussed onstage, which you can watch in full on YouTube.\r\n",{"instance":132},{"__typename":133,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"content":134},"LightBlueContentComponent","1. Invest in building trust with founders/CEOs \r\n\r\n2. Create a strategy that solves your customer's problem\r\n\r\n3. Relentlessly prioritize product innovation resources\r\n\r\n4. Balance existing roadmap and customer needs with transformational technology (AI)\r\n\r\n5. Communicate clearly - especially in times of dynamic change \r\n",{"instance":136},{"__typename":129,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":137},"Tune in for insights on when to hire your first CPO (and when to hold off), how to set the best metrics to truly solve your customers’ problems and ways to embed AI into your product roadmap without blowing up your plans.",{"instance":139},{"__typename":140,"heading":12,"videoId":141,"thumbnail":142,"source":144},"Video","cVv7LCQNnHg",{"id":143,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":5,"assetUrlXs":5,"assetUrlSm":5,"assetUrlMd":5,"assetUrlLg":5,"assetUrlXl":5,"assetUrlXxl":5},"1385","Youtube",{"id":146,"assetUrl":5},"343",{"assetUrl":5},[],"the-playbook-for-building-and-scaling-great-products-wisdom-from-the-chief-product-officers-of-rubrik-grammarly-and-slack",[151],{"fullName":152,"teamSubcategories":153,"slug":170,"image":171,"abbreviatedTitle":180,"focusAreas":181,"emailAddress":182,"bio":183},"Tamar Yehoshua",[154,160,166],{"name":155,"slug":156,"teamCategory":157},"All","all",{"name":158,"slug":159},"Operators","operators",{"name":161,"slug":162,"teamCategory":163},"Apps","apps",{"name":164,"slug":165},"Investors","investors",{"name":167,"slug":168,"teamCategory":169},"Consumer","consumer",{"name":164,"slug":165},"tamar-yehoshua",{"id":172,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":173,"assetUrlXs":174,"assetUrlSm":175,"assetUrlMd":176,"assetUrlLg":177,"assetUrlXl":178,"assetUrlXxl":179},"2755","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","Venture Partner","Artificial Intelligence, Enterprise SaaS, Consumer Tech","tamar.yehoshua@glean.com","I am currently Chief Product and AI Officer at Atlassian. Over the past few months, I’ve met with incredible founders and executives, gaining an up-close view of how AI is transforming every industry and reshaping the way we work. It has become clear that every product we use today must be reimagined for this new era—and that is something I’m deeply motivated to help drive.\r\n\r\nPreviously, I was at Glean, where we built an AI-powered work assistant. Before that, I had the privilege of working at exceptional companies during their growth phases, including Amazon, Google, and Slack. Having been in the trenches—building products people love and scaling organizations to meet extraordinary demand—I learned enduring lessons about product leadership, execution, and scale.\r\n\r\nAt IVP, I share these learnings with entrepreneurs building the next generation of companies that will meaningfully improve people’s daily lives. I focus on supporting each company wherever I can, always acting with empathy for the incredibly difficult work founders do. As new technologies continue to emerge, the opportunity for startups has never been greater, and I’m excited to partner with entrepreneurs as they turn ambitious visions into reality.",{"id":185,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":186,"assetUrlXs":187,"assetUrlSm":188,"assetUrlMd":189,"assetUrlLg":190,"assetUrlXl":191,"assetUrlXxl":192},"1383","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/xs_SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/sm_SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/md_SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/lg_SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/xl_SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1383/xxl_SaaStr_Tile_Image.png","Wisdom from the Chief Product Officers of Rubrik, Grammarly and Slack ",1790351930153]